# Runtime roadmap (Wave 4)

## Today
- Interpreter (correctness, full language)
- SVM bytecode (subset / parity growing)

## Near-term faster path (not full native yet)
1. Prefer `s vm` for numeric hot loops when supported
2. Avoid huge string concat in tight loops
3. Precompute constants outside loops
4. Long-term: optional native backend or PyPy host

S remains Python-hosted for the official 3.5 line.
